{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.950000762939453,"text":"Honestly, everyone's been stopping me about the bag. This is the Meridian from Volantra, all pepled leather, silver hardware, no logo anywhere, and my laptop sits flat inside. The dress is Zimmerman, hat is Janessa Leon, shoes are Akwesasne, David Yerman, and this one was my grandmother's. Six colors, $125, and everyone assumes it was more. Links below.","words":[{"word":"Honestly","start":0.0,"end":0.7400000095367432},{"word":"everyone's","start":0.7400000095367432,"end":1.2400000095367432},{"word":"been","start":1.2400000095367432,"end":1.440000057220459},{"word":"stopping","start":1.440000057220459,"end":1.7599999904632568},{"word":"me","start":1.7599999904632568,"end":2.0199999809265137},{"word":"about","start":2.0199999809265137,"end":2.2200000286102295},{"word":"the","start":2.2200000286102295,"end":2.4200000762939453},{"word":"bag","start":2.4200000762939453,"end":2.740000009536743},{"word":"This","start":3.140000104904175,"end":3.380000114440918},{"word":"is","start":3.380000114440918,"end":3.5999999046325684},{"word":"the","start":3.5999999046325684,"end":3.859999895095825},{"word":"Meridian","start":3.859999895095825,"end":4.179999828338623},{"word":"from","start":4.179999828338623,"end":4.699999809265137},{"word":"Volantra","start":4.699999809265137,"end":5.28000020980835},{"word":"all","start":5.880000114440918,"end":6.119999885559082},{"word":"pepled","start":6.119999885559082,"end":6.380000114440918},{"word":"leather","start":6.380000114440918,"end":6.760000228881836},{"word":"silver","start":7.420000076293945,"end":7.539999961853027},{"word":"hardware","start":7.539999961853027,"end":8.020000457763672},{"word":"no","start":8.359999656677246,"end":8.579999923706055},{"word":"logo","start":8.579999923706055,"end":8.859999656677246},{"word":"anywhere","start":8.859999656677246,"end":9.399999618530273},{"word":"and","start":9.579999923706055,"end":9.819999694824219},{"word":"m